    "Explicit light/dark 100/125/150 percent upstream and conversation keyboard matrices show complete focus outlines and Chinese error alerts. At 150 percent, later settings controls and the ninth sidebar category require vertical scrolling.",
    "Conversation titles preserve pinned/archive labels and use trailing ellipsis for long names; the bottom action focus outlines are fully visible.",
    "Initial overview filenames ending light inherited dark theme; the explicit six-case overview matrices show their named themes. The page-two base capture shows the repository heading; pagination controls are farther down, and the actual native queries separately prove 20/1/20 pagination.",
    "Project creation light zoom originals use 1280x840, while dark zoom originals use 760x540; they do not prove six minimum-window cases. At dark 150 percent the form body scrolls while footer actions remain visible.",
    "PDF originals show first-page content and close focus in both themes and three zoom levels. At 150 percent the visible PDF viewport is shorter; these originals do not show the entire document.",
    "Comparison error originals show complete alerts in six theme/zoom cases. At larger zoom, configuration and results use vertical scrolling; the 150 percent result capture shows the first conversation action focus and second heading, with the second reply farther down."
